{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32381","headline":"雪二首 一 · 温庭筠","name":"雪二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"砚水池先冻，窗风酒易消。\n鸦声出山郭，人迹过村桥。\n稍急方萦转，才深未寂寥。\n细光穿暗隟，轻白驻寒条。\n草静封还折，松攲堕复摇。\n谢庄今病眼，无意坐通宵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}